{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-17_end","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-17","title":"晶簇之內","storyCode":"14-19","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-17_end.txt","sourceHash":"a1fca9c0587f2e8e6141f41a06a2e4fbe96aff7ce6f4f0d66edd14f8066b57a0","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"博士離開那處神秘之地，卻發現自己身處羅德島，且身邊環繞著未曾料想過的同伴。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"我回到了這裡。\n自己好像已經離開了很久，很久都沒有回到這艘船上，睡過一個好覺。\n博士，凱爾希醫生，推進之王小姐……\n外面的戰爭停止了嗎？終於，可以休息一會了。\n可以去餐廳喝一碗熱乎乎的蔬菜湯，然後回到宿舍躺在自己的床上。\n特蕾西婭小姐呢？這個時候，她應該——\n……\n不……不對……\n特蕾西婭小姐已經離開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"房間是空的，沒有人等待自己回來。\n可自己分明記得，曾經有一個人坐在這裡，在許多夜晚，講過許多故事哄自己入睡。\n現在，這裡什麼都沒有剩下。\n等一下……床上為什麼放著一件衣服？\n一件白色的禮裙，衣領上縫上了好看的襟花。針腳細密，是很熟悉的手藝。\n“阿米婭，很適合穿白色的衣服呢。”\n特蕾西婭小姐……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遙遠的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變近的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你能聽到我的聲音嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你果然，在這裡……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（好難受。）","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"（剛才發生了什麼事？）","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"（我現在又在哪裡？）","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來身體狀況不是很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能沒有辦法在這裡對你進行身體檢查，博士，請保持清醒，看著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……有沒有回想起什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你聽到女性嚴厲但關懷的話語，努力地睁大眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"視野漸漸清晰，身體的部分機能也正在逐漸恢復。\n你緩緩開口——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（未知語言）凱爾希……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"（未知語言）我這是在哪裡？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"破碎的意識拼湊起來，斷裂的思緒恢復條理，你現在可以確信，自己正站在堅實的地面上。\n你環顧四周，你很確定這就是你熟悉的環境，你在這裡度過了很長一段時光。\n而眼前的女性看向你的眼神變得陌生，甚至是，帶有敵意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（未知語言）我是誰……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我是誰？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i11"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i15"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i16"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我是羅德島的Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"凱爾希！我們為什麼在羅德島？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……看上去，你還記得你是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭不在我們身邊，可以確定的是，這一定不是原本的羅德島。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們和其他人走散了？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"Logos、W又在哪裡？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來到這裡後我見到的只有你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對這一切，真的毫無頭緒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我正一頭霧水。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你是不是……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……不相信我？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……一定程度的戒備在這種情況下是必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，博士。無論如何，我們要離開這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不是我們熟悉的環境，不知道會遇到什麼意外狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是會盡量保護你，不要離我太遠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"不……不行了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"連下個月的運動量都要用光了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"不可以這樣，克洛絲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是實戰演習，要把訓練室當作戰場！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長打人好狠……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"都打起精神來，教官給我們安排的訓練任務還有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼關係嘛……反正教官又不在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是博士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"早安，克洛絲。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"大家……都在這裡？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛絲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的，博士一定不會跟教官打小報告的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"先在這裡，舒服的躺上一會——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我記得給你們安排的訓練任務不是潛行偽裝吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"……完了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"A1小隊全體都有，立正！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小隊眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"每個人，繞場地跑一百圈，然後體能訓練組合五十次，現在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小隊眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"讓你見笑了，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島確實有太長時間沒有經歷過戰事，這些年輕的戰士們有些懈怠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"我會負責讓她們緊張起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"能維持這樣的平靜，也很好……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，但也必須為可能到來的危險做準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，這裡的訓練不勞你費心，我會處理好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間你辛苦了，博士，去休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我們都會守在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希……你看到了嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我是不是在做夢？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到的畫面與你一致，他們確實存在於此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會有這樣清晰的夢境，這也並非你的回憶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果這一切都是真的就好了……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"不，這一定不是真的。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保持清醒，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還要繼續向前走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稀客，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有時間坐下來喝一杯嗎？今晚所有的酒都算在我的帳上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好熱鬧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這麼多人？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘了嗎博士，今天舉辦的是Outcast的退休儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"敬我們尊敬的老前輩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了Sharp，你也沒比我小多少。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"感謝你對羅德島的付出，Outcast。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"退休快樂。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":"avg_npc_095","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會記得你的事蹟和精湛的射術的，敬你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Outcast也要走了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"以後再也沒有人，在週末晚上陪我……嗝……喝酒了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，我只是退休，拉特蘭的追悼會都不會這麼傷感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，就算我今晚醉過去，明天一早再也沒有醒來，我這一生也已經足夠精彩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與大家同行的時光是我最珍貴的寶物，我會把這段回憶連我的守護銃一起帶到墳墓裡去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是以後教年輕人射擊的工作就交給巡林者了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你醉了Outcast，他用的是銃，怎麼能教——嗝——薩科塔的弩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":"avg_npc_095","isRemote":false,"text":"少喝點，都說傻話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不都是睜一隻眼閉一隻眼，沒太大差別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，今晚酒吧的客人不止我們呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"認真點達格達！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我瞧瞧，接受冊封的塔樓騎士的拳頭到底有多重！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這是你自找的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！這裡不是拳館，我們是來羅德島做客的，別太過分！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有過這樣的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正式成為蒸汽騎士，就要和我們這些街頭混混決裂了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別打趣我……你真的想好了，維娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼好猶豫的，在諾伯特區的這段日子是我有生以來最開心的時光，我沒有必要再回到那座宮殿裡去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞歷山德莉娜·維娜·維多利亞是王室後裔，也是一名普通的、光榮的維多利亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛，今後你就是光榮的蒸汽騎士，而我則是光榮的“推進之王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信現在這樣的生活，就是最好的安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和平的生活，彌足珍貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敬生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敬維多利亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你有心情的時候，我們到處走走吧。比如說，一起去拿石頭丟那些公爵家的窗戶怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"真好啊。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得他們每個人，你真切地為他們的遭遇感到遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則你不會看到這些畫面。"}]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在心情如何，博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欣慰，困惑還是憤怒？"}]},{"label":"這不是真的。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些都是你的潛意識中你所期待的畫面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你希望這一切都是真的，對嗎？"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我還會在這裡見到誰？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有你自己會知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續走吧，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你看到什麼，直面它，跨過它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，好久不見，我回來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……塔露拉？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，只是一段時間不見，不認識我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"這次去烏薩斯北邊建立感染者收治中心，還是花了不少功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"還好城鎮的工人很支持我們，當地的領主不得不妥協，我們爭取到了足夠的土地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"整合運動不存在了……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你又在開玩笑了，還是沒有睡醒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動不存在的話，和羅德島合作，在烏薩斯幫助治療感染者的又是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那科西切呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼突然提起那條死掉的“黑蛇”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"是又想讓我說謝謝嗎？行啊。畢竟，是羅德島幫我和烏薩斯永遠擺脫了那個禍首，給無數人的未來起了個好頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰冷的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"（不要回頭。）","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"avg_1505_frstar_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"………………","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"霜星……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你不該出現在這裡。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"avg_1505_frstar_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"avg_1505_frstar_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是你要我完成任務之後，立刻來找你報告的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"羅德島的……任務？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"avg_1505_frstar_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是羅德島的任務。我一直都是羅德島的一員。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"avg_1505_frstar_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來很奇怪。我離太近，讓你覺得冷了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不對。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"不對……","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"不對！！","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g14_rhodescorridor_ex"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個個鮮活的人褪去了真實的外表，化為漆黑模糊的影子。\n它們看上去並不危險，只是圍繞在你身邊，緩緩遊蕩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希……這些都是什麼？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這並非幻境，或是夢境。在某種意義上講，這一切同樣是真實存在的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"存在於你的想像中，是你過去遇到過的人與事，按你最期待的樣子發展出的幻景。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是對我們經歷過的一切的玷污。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你為什麼還能這麼冷靜？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些畫面對我的觸動並不比你弱，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是歸根結底，這些還是由你自己創造的畫面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是源石，按照你潛意識深處的期待和想要彌補某些遺憾的想法，“複製”出的景象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你依然深刻地記得與羅德島同行經歷過的一切，你同樣擺脫了美好謊言的欺瞞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在才可以確信，現在的你，還是羅德島的博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"源石？可以做到這種事？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"為什麼是按我所期待的？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"普瑞……賽斯……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你果然已經……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我曾經對你說過，關於你自身的謎題，無法透過他人之口告訴你，只有靠你自己來解開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我們現在離那個終點很近了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果這一切都是我的期望，那你……","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你與我相處的經驗足以讓你做出準確的判斷。"}]},{"label":"我至少可以確定，你不是我幻想的樣子。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望讓你做出這個判斷的，是你的理智，而不是其他。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果這裡的畫面都是為了彌補遺憾……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我會在這裡見到特蕾西婭嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法確定特蕾西婭身在何處，又在做些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們所處的環境，一定與她有關。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"——！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，凱爾希醫生。太好了，你們都在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（猶豫）","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，博士，我是阿米婭，貨真價實。"}]},{"label":"（毫不猶豫地上前）","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……博士，我一直在找你。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你看起來有些不一樣。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這身衣服是……","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是特蕾西婭小姐留給我的衣服。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她果然在這裡？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有見到她。這艘“羅德島”上也並沒有她的氣息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你沒有遇到危險吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多回憶流向了我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不只是回憶，還有情感，各種各樣的，豐富情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，我們見到的這些人，他們確實是活著的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這種形式的“活著”，令我……悲傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"穿過這條走廊，見到你之後，我明白了過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我觸碰到的情感，有著同一個源頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……我。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……“碰”到你了，博士。以前都沒過……"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩牽住了你的手，和過去一樣，或許更小心、更用力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的。博士和過去相比有了很多變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們一起經歷了這麼多，我更確信的是……站在我面前的，一直都是我最信任的你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回憶說不定會騙人，情感絕不可能作假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有許多事情……可能我現在也無法弄清楚。有些疑問，可能要等到再次見到特蕾西婭小姐才能得到解答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論接下來將會發生什麼，無論我們會面臨多麼悲傷的結局……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你會和我站在一起，對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我會。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我是羅德島的Dr.{@nickname}。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……好的，現在這樣就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們先去找到特蕾西婭小姐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們先想辦法離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"答案不在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g11_rhodesdeck_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖說並非幻術所致，但天與地，生與死……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無一不是虛假。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，就算走出那悶死人的假畫廊，也只能待在一個更大的舞台上兜兜轉轉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰給我們裝上這層幕布？這品味可一點都說不上好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唷，主角們可算到場啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老女人，快，動一下妳那無所不知的腦子，先回答那個最關鍵的問題——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們，現在，到底，在哪？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一葉小舟，漂泊在漫無邊際的金色海洋上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是，“源石”的內部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“源石”的內部，存在著一個“宇宙”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_122_beagle","aliases":["米格魯"]},{"speakerId":"char_123_fang","aliases":["芬"]},{"speakerId":"char_124_kroos","aliases":["克洛絲"]}]}
